WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:34.674 --> 00:01:37.666
"Tenchi Anniversary"

00:01:40.414 --> 00:01:42.949
It was two years ago today...

00:01:42.949 --> 00:01:46.787
...when we and Tenchi
had our first, fateful meeting.

00:01:46.787 --> 00:01:53.727
And so, in thanks to Tenchi for
opening his heart and home to us aliens,

00:01:53.727 --> 00:01:58.198
we designate today "Tenchi Anniversary"
in hopes of repaying him, however slightly,

00:01:58.198 --> 00:02:02.828
and modest though it may be, we
have prepared this banquet in his honor.

00:02:04.271 --> 00:02:08.608
And with your permission,
I will lead today's toast.

00:02:08.608 --> 00:02:09.643
And so...

00:02:09.643 --> 00:02:11.077
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

00:02:11.077 --> 00:02:12.408
Ryoko, don't...

00:02:15.682 --> 00:02:18.452
Tenchi, I'm sorry...

00:02:18.452 --> 00:02:19.885
Whatever.

00:02:30.363 --> 00:02:34.459
I'm here. I'm in Tenchi's hometown...

00:02:39.773 --> 00:02:44.311
But I still... I still...

00:02:44.311 --> 00:02:50.283
I still like Masaki, so I came to see him.
And when I do, I'll tell him again.

00:02:50.283 --> 00:02:51.773
I'll tell him again.

00:02:54.754 --> 00:02:57.424
I feel a little sorry for that girl.

00:02:57.424 --> 00:02:59.517
Maybe I'll help her out.

00:03:21.615 --> 00:03:23.683
Tenchi, open wide!

00:03:23.683 --> 00:03:25.385
That's okay, I can feed myself.

00:03:25.385 --> 00:03:26.853
Lord Tenchi!

00:03:26.853 --> 00:03:29.756
This cucumber roll tastes better!

00:03:29.756 --> 00:03:32.859
My food tastes better!

00:03:32.859 --> 00:03:36.852
Come on, Sasami made both of them!

00:03:37.764 --> 00:03:42.636
He's right. Your cooking today's
even better than usual, Sasami.

00:03:42.636 --> 00:03:44.838
I worked extra hard on it today!

00:03:44.838 --> 00:03:48.467
Today's the anniversary of the
day we first met Tenchi, after all!

00:03:49.943 --> 00:03:54.881
- Here, Tenchi!
- The fact that you threw
this party for me is plenty.

00:03:54.881 --> 00:03:57.645
I wasn't able to do anything.

00:04:01.354 --> 00:04:04.755
It's all because of this
memento of my mother's.

00:04:08.094 --> 00:04:11.398
That's right. If it weren't for this...

00:04:11.398 --> 00:04:18.204
If we hadn't run into Tenchi, we
wouldn't be having this party right now.

00:04:18.204 --> 00:04:20.069
True...

00:04:25.378 --> 00:04:27.073
Sister!

00:04:41.194 --> 00:04:42.963
How is she?

00:04:42.963 --> 00:04:46.299
She's tough, so she won't die, but...

00:04:46.299 --> 00:04:48.969
She's hurt bad.

00:04:48.969 --> 00:04:51.233
Um... I...

00:04:52.672 --> 00:04:56.810
Thanks. You saved us all.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.279
No, I just...

00:04:59.279 --> 00:05:02.976
Don't lose that necklace.

00:05:07.287 --> 00:05:11.658
Let me study that
necklace's power later, okay?

00:05:11.658 --> 00:05:13.493
Yours, too.

00:05:13.493 --> 00:05:15.393
W-Washu...

00:05:16.563 --> 00:05:21.500
I can't believe my mom's old necklace
had that kind of horrible power...

00:05:34.547 --> 00:05:36.037
Tenchi.

00:05:37.183 --> 00:05:38.885
Grandpa!

00:05:38.885 --> 00:05:41.054
What's this necklace?!

00:05:41.054 --> 00:05:47.618
Tenchi. For now, just worry about
those girls from space getting better.

00:05:52.565 --> 00:05:55.769
But don't forget <i>this:</i>

00:05:55.769 --> 00:05:58.972
The time will come
when you'll have to use it.

00:05:58.972 --> 00:06:01.541
It will come.

00:06:01.541 --> 00:06:03.236
Grandpa...

00:06:36.576 --> 00:06:37.907
Here.

00:07:14.414 --> 00:07:16.473
It's so pretty!

00:07:17.784 --> 00:07:20.420
It's as pretty as Jurai here!

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:23.089
Yes. As pretty as Jurai.

00:07:23.089 --> 00:07:25.692
Perhaps even more so.

00:07:25.692 --> 00:07:26.993
Sister?

00:07:26.993 --> 00:07:30.053
Would it be okay if we didn't go back?

00:07:31.798 --> 00:07:33.233
Sister?

00:07:33.233 --> 00:07:35.064
I don't want to go back.

00:07:36.369 --> 00:07:38.132
Sister...

00:07:40.206 --> 00:07:42.003
Tenchi?

00:07:45.044 --> 00:07:46.312
Ayeka?

00:07:46.312 --> 00:07:47.981
Lord Tenchi?

00:07:47.981 --> 00:07:51.184
I've made a full recovery, thanks to you.

00:07:51.184 --> 00:07:52.919
Thank you.

00:07:52.919 --> 00:07:55.444
Ayeka! Cut it out!

00:07:57.090 --> 00:08:00.426
Uh... Ayeka, let's have dinner.

00:08:00.426 --> 00:08:02.729
I cooked it today.

00:08:02.729 --> 00:08:07.167
It may look a little scary,
but let's eat together.

00:08:07.167 --> 00:08:08.668
All right.

00:08:08.668 --> 00:08:11.603
Sister... Don't tell me she's...

00:08:12.872 --> 00:08:14.874
This is so beautiful!

00:08:14.874 --> 00:08:18.411
Tenchi Masaki, huh?
They'd make a good couple.

00:08:18.411 --> 00:08:19.901
Yeah.

00:08:34.561 --> 00:08:37.096
That you, Tenchi?

00:08:37.096 --> 00:08:38.898
How is she, Washu?

00:08:38.898 --> 00:08:41.334
She still hasn't regained consciousness.

00:08:41.334 --> 00:08:43.962
She did take quite a pounding, you know.

00:08:50.643 --> 00:08:53.213
Tenchi! You have a visitor!

00:08:53.213 --> 00:08:55.181
Sakuya!

00:08:55.181 --> 00:08:57.116
I knew it!

00:08:57.116 --> 00:08:59.319
She was lost, wandering
around the bus stop,

00:08:59.319 --> 00:09:03.189
and when we got to talking,
she said she was your classmate!

00:09:03.189 --> 00:09:05.592
Good evening, Masaki.

00:09:05.592 --> 00:09:07.694
The thing is, I...

00:09:07.694 --> 00:09:11.858
Mr. Masaki, there's no food left! Ayeka ate...

00:09:13.166 --> 00:09:16.870
You! What's the big idea,
coming all the way out here?!

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:20.039
What are the people from
Monster Busters doing here?

00:09:20.039 --> 00:09:21.908
We live here.

00:09:21.908 --> 00:09:26.579
You live here? At Masaki's house?

00:09:26.579 --> 00:09:28.069
Come on in.

00:09:29.749 --> 00:09:31.784
You're having some kind of party?

00:09:31.784 --> 00:09:36.356
That's right. A really, really important one.

00:09:36.356 --> 00:09:39.292
So no outsiders are allowed.

00:09:39.292 --> 00:09:44.898
Now, now, Ryoko. I'm sure she'd never
be convinced even if we got her to leave.

00:09:44.898 --> 00:09:48.902
We'll tell you why it is...

00:09:48.902 --> 00:09:51.938
...that today is so important
that it needs to be celebrated.

00:09:51.938 --> 00:09:52.939
Uh...

00:09:52.939 --> 00:09:59.712
Two years ago to the day was
our fateful first meeting with Tenchi.

00:09:59.712 --> 00:10:03.483
Because of the bond of this gem...

00:10:03.483 --> 00:10:06.019
The gem! It's gone!

00:10:06.019 --> 00:10:09.088
You probably wolfed it down
along with all those cucumber rolls.

00:10:09.088 --> 00:10:11.491
I'll show you mine.

00:10:11.491 --> 00:10:14.027
Huh? What the...

00:10:14.027 --> 00:10:15.695
It's gone!

00:10:15.695 --> 00:10:16.763
It's gone!

00:10:16.763 --> 00:10:18.364
Mine's gone!

00:10:18.364 --> 00:10:20.066
Mine, too?

00:10:20.066 --> 00:10:22.626
My mom's necklace! It's gone!

00:10:43.423 --> 00:10:44.857
The gems...

00:10:44.857 --> 00:10:46.492
...that Tenchi got...

00:10:46.492 --> 00:10:47.527
...from his mother!

00:10:47.527 --> 00:10:49.162
They're gone!

00:10:49.162 --> 00:10:51.664
A memento of his mother?

00:10:51.664 --> 00:10:54.400
I've got it, Tenchi!

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.766
She took 'em!

00:10:59.072 --> 00:11:00.406
Think about it!

00:11:00.406 --> 00:11:04.610
Just when she shows up, the gems
that we always have with us disappear!

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:07.747
It's obvious that she stole them!

00:11:07.747 --> 00:11:09.816
What? But I wouldn't...

00:11:09.816 --> 00:11:10.817
Ryoko!

00:11:10.817 --> 00:11:15.822
You must admit that it's entirely possible.

00:11:15.822 --> 00:11:17.722
Not you, too, Ayeka...

00:11:21.828 --> 00:11:24.464
But I... I...

00:11:24.464 --> 00:11:27.797
All we have to do is search her.

00:11:30.436 --> 00:11:32.370
They're not here.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:37.669
She must've hidden them somewhere!

00:11:43.216 --> 00:11:45.446
Well? Say something!

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:49.789
I didn't take anything!

00:11:49.789 --> 00:11:51.157
What?

00:11:51.157 --> 00:11:54.794
How could I? I just got here!

00:11:54.794 --> 00:11:57.363
Still playing innocent, huh?

00:11:57.363 --> 00:11:59.298
I never did like you.

00:11:59.298 --> 00:12:01.768
You were always trying to get your
hands on Tenchi, you damn cat burglar...

00:12:01.768 --> 00:12:04.999
And now you're a gem thief, too!

00:12:06.472 --> 00:12:09.202
Give back those gems!

00:12:16.115 --> 00:12:18.985
If you don't tell me where
they are, I'll go look for them

00:12:18.985 --> 00:12:20.953
after I kick the crap out of you!

00:12:23.589 --> 00:12:24.424
Stop!

00:12:24.424 --> 00:12:25.982
Lord Tenchi!

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:28.995
Tenchi...

00:12:28.995 --> 00:12:30.895
That's enough, Ryoko.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.865
Out of my way, Tenchi! I'll make her fess up!

00:12:39.505 --> 00:12:42.303
Sakuya wouldn't do anything like that.

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:54.987
Why? Why are you standing up for her?!

00:12:54.987 --> 00:12:56.389
Tenchi, you jerk!

00:12:56.389 --> 00:12:57.757
Jerk!

00:12:57.757 --> 00:12:59.384
Ryoko!

00:13:01.994 --> 00:13:04.063
Damn it! Damn it!

00:13:04.063 --> 00:13:06.861
Damn it!

00:13:11.437 --> 00:13:13.234
Ryoko...

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:23.983
Masaki stood up for me...

00:13:23.983 --> 00:13:26.452
But if she didn't do it, who did?

00:13:26.452 --> 00:13:28.588
It's simple.

00:13:28.588 --> 00:13:33.759
Washu! What have you been up to?

00:13:33.759 --> 00:13:35.094
This and that...

00:13:35.094 --> 00:13:37.119
I've been looking for this.

00:13:38.564 --> 00:13:40.399
What is it? What is it?

00:13:40.399 --> 00:13:42.969
The Washu Special Gem Radar.

00:13:42.969 --> 00:13:49.041
In other words, it can detect the
special energy given off by the gems.

00:13:49.041 --> 00:13:50.668
I just press this, and...

00:13:52.078 --> 00:13:54.171
The thief is in this room.

00:13:56.082 --> 00:13:57.515
The thief is...

00:13:59.519 --> 00:14:01.077
There!

00:14:14.867 --> 00:14:16.035
The necklace!

00:14:16.035 --> 00:14:16.802
So it was...

00:14:16.802 --> 00:14:19.205
...some guardian spirit
that just appeared recently...

00:14:19.205 --> 00:14:21.639
...that took them, then?

00:14:25.111 --> 00:14:26.712
It's coming this way!

00:14:26.712 --> 00:14:28.373
How foolish...

00:14:36.989 --> 00:14:42.261
Everyone, those gems are a sign
of the bond between us and Tenchi.

00:14:42.261 --> 00:14:44.096
Let's get them back,
even if it costs us our lives!

00:14:44.096 --> 00:14:45.598
Yeah!

00:14:45.598 --> 00:14:48.032
A sign of the bond between them?

00:14:49.802 --> 00:14:51.463
Masaki...

00:14:58.544 --> 00:15:01.981
Tenchi...

00:15:01.981 --> 00:15:05.585
When I was lying there in
bed, I couldn't forgive you.

00:15:05.585 --> 00:15:08.349
Or maybe it was just
that I was so frustrated...

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:14.193
A kid from some
backwater planet took out me,

00:15:14.193 --> 00:15:17.763
the one they call the <i>#1</i> pirate in the galaxy.

00:15:17.763 --> 00:15:21.033
"Once my body heals,
we'll finish this once and for all..."

00:15:21.033 --> 00:15:22.935
Or so I thought.

00:15:22.935 --> 00:15:25.699
But when Tenchi came...

00:15:34.513 --> 00:15:38.784
He took care of me day after day.

00:15:38.784 --> 00:15:42.550
He looked after me without
thinking of himself at all.

00:16:01.407 --> 00:16:04.043
You still haven't woken up?

00:16:04.043 --> 00:16:08.614
But Washu says you should
come around any time now...

00:16:08.614 --> 00:16:12.752
Once you wake up,
I'll show you around Earth.

00:16:12.752 --> 00:16:15.621
You talked to me about all sorts of things.

00:16:15.621 --> 00:16:21.794
"The amusement parks and hot
springs here on Earth are a lot of fun..."

00:16:21.794 --> 00:16:26.866
"There's all kinds of good
stuff to eat. I bet you'll like 'em."

00:16:26.866 --> 00:16:32.305
When you were done telling me
stories, you'd usually just leave,

00:16:32.305 --> 00:16:37.109
But for some reason, on that day of
all days, you stayed with me all night.

00:16:37.109 --> 00:16:40.746
I know this won't make up for what I did.

00:16:40.746 --> 00:16:42.014
I'm sorry.

00:16:42.014 --> 00:16:47.553
I can't believe I hurt a girl so badly...

00:16:47.553 --> 00:16:49.789
I know you'll want to get even.

00:16:49.789 --> 00:16:53.122
I'll do anything. So please...

00:16:56.662 --> 00:17:01.000
So please, open your eyes...

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.797
He...

00:17:08.441 --> 00:17:10.943
Tenchi...

00:17:10.943 --> 00:17:13.412
Ryoko!

00:17:13.412 --> 00:17:14.970
Tenchi?

00:17:16.015 --> 00:17:20.349
Ryoko! That's the guy! That's the thief!

00:17:22.988 --> 00:17:25.224
A guardian spirit?

00:17:25.224 --> 00:17:28.160
Now I get it! So you're the real thief, huh?

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:31.364
You stole the bond between Tenchi and me...

00:17:31.364 --> 00:17:33.559
You're gonna pay for that!

00:17:35.968 --> 00:17:40.405
You're dead!

00:17:46.712 --> 00:17:49.248
Miss Ryoko!

00:17:49.248 --> 00:17:52.852
Thank goodness you're awake!

00:17:52.852 --> 00:17:59.725
What? Is that the face of the man
who took out the galaxy's <i>#1</i> pirate?

00:17:59.725 --> 00:18:01.488
What?

00:18:06.132 --> 00:18:10.736
I don't wanna go through that again,
so I think I'll hold on to this for you.

00:18:10.736 --> 00:18:12.138
What're you talking about?

00:18:12.138 --> 00:18:13.839
Oops!

00:18:13.839 --> 00:18:17.536
I'm gonna be staying at
your place for a while, after all.

00:18:18.911 --> 00:18:20.469
Miss Ryoko...

00:18:21.614 --> 00:18:23.548
Just "Ryoko."

00:18:28.654 --> 00:18:31.023
Everybody!

00:18:31.023 --> 00:18:33.492
When did you pick up those gems?

00:18:33.492 --> 00:18:39.899
If Ryoko says that she'll be
staying, I certainly can't leave.

00:18:39.899 --> 00:18:43.528
You should just say that you don't want to go!

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:50.810
Keeping an eye on the space pirate
Ryoko is one of our duties as Galaxy Police.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:54.507
You should just ask him if we can live here!

00:18:56.215 --> 00:18:59.218
This planet seems like a nice place to stay,

00:18:59.218 --> 00:19:03.255
and I want to analyze this gem's power, too.

00:19:03.255 --> 00:19:05.524
I think I'll impose on you for a while!

00:19:05.524 --> 00:19:10.463
Nobody needs you here! Find some
other planet, you bunch of meddlers!!

00:19:10.463 --> 00:19:12.431
"Meddlers"?

00:19:12.431 --> 00:19:18.995
No one has ever spoken to me, the
First Princess of Jurai, in such a manner!

00:19:20.639 --> 00:19:22.475
I'll say it as many times as I want!

00:19:22.475 --> 00:19:26.345
Meddler! Meddler! Meddler!

00:19:26.345 --> 00:19:27.713
You little...

00:19:27.713 --> 00:19:29.782
Cut it out, you two!

00:19:29.782 --> 00:19:32.852
We can all live together, okay?

00:19:32.852 --> 00:19:34.386
Really?

00:19:34.386 --> 00:19:36.489
Uh... Yeah.

00:19:36.489 --> 00:19:38.457
Great!

00:19:39.925 --> 00:19:41.722
Oh, what the heck.

00:19:51.237 --> 00:19:55.264
Okay... Let's get back to the party!

00:20:02.948 --> 00:20:05.109
Masaki?

00:20:21.967 --> 00:20:24.203
I don't belong here.

00:20:24.203 --> 00:20:25.932
Young lady.

00:20:27.373 --> 00:20:30.968
It's dangerous to be out alone at night.

00:20:32.344 --> 00:20:38.717
I was surprised. I surprised myself
by chasing after him all this way.

00:20:38.717 --> 00:20:41.987
But I shouldn't have come.

00:20:41.987 --> 00:20:48.859
Stay here tonight. You can go
back to Tokyo with Tenchi tomorrow.

00:20:57.703 --> 00:20:59.605
These people are amazing.

00:20:59.605 --> 00:21:02.441
The bond between them is
even stronger than I thought.

00:21:02.441 --> 00:21:04.773
I suppose I should be
satisfied with learning that.

00:21:35.474 --> 00:21:39.078
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.078 --> 00:21:42.982
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:42.982 --> 00:21:46.585
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:46.585 --> 00:21:50.522
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:50.522 --> 00:21:54.026
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.026 --> 00:21:57.997
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:57.997 --> 00:22:01.333
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:01.333 --> 00:22:05.337
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:05.337 --> 00:22:07.473
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:07.473 --> 00:22:09.408
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:09.408 --> 00:22:10.909
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:10.909 --> 00:22:16.749
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:16.749 --> 00:22:20.853
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:20.853 --> 00:22:24.123
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.123 --> 00:22:27.660
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:32.359
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:40.739 --> 00:22:42.374
Hi, Kiyone here!

00:22:42.374 --> 00:22:44.843
We did it, Mihoshi! We got a job!

00:22:44.843 --> 00:22:47.312
We're going to help out with the excavation...

00:22:47.312 --> 00:22:49.348
...of some ruins they just
found in suburban Tokyo!

00:22:49.348 --> 00:22:53.052
None of the others will be around,
so we'll finally be able to work in peace!

00:22:53.052 --> 00:22:56.121
Let's start right away, Mihoshi!

00:22:56.121 --> 00:22:59.224
Hey, isn't that Ayeka over there?

00:22:59.224 --> 00:23:01.827
What? You're looking for Tenchi?

00:23:01.827 --> 00:23:04.563
I've got a bad feeling about this...

00:23:04.563 --> 00:23:10.092
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"The Guardians of Old."
